{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の14時過ぎに発生した"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鳥取県を震源とする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地震の報道を知り、驚いています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近隣にお住まいのファンの皆さま、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご無事でしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先月のアンダーライブツアーで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんお世話になった中国地方での"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被害の知らせに胸が痛みます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際に地震に遭われた方ではなくても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親戚や友人のことを心配する気持ちだったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メディアの報道を受けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前の災害を思い出してしまったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にたくさんの方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安を感じていらっしゃると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余震や二次災害など、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々な心配と隣り合わせだと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身も心も張り詰めて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいいっぱいになってしまいますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかお気をつけて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜にかけて不安も膨らむだろうし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すこしでも心を休ませられるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できるだけあたたかくしてくださいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被災された地域の皆さまの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご無事を祈っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 山崎怜奈"}],"source":"archive"}